      "message": "Hi Keith and Abhishek. Following up on the discussion this morning, here is an update for PD power button support on PDC platforms. This does use the non-UCSI RTK interface to read Alert information into the PDC power manager. To do this, it adds \"vendor_status\" which is a new data object for PDCs to report interrupts which are not supported by UCSI. Let me know if you have any questions",
